rf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Beaver County has 75 years of record since 1951 on 8 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, August to September and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle got 47% of normal in July to August and 56% in August to September. Grid 25100 has a preliminary estimate of 135.6 for July to August 2026, from NOAA rain and not the final RMA index.</p>"}
